WEBVTT

00:18:59.913 --> 00:19:05.329
So the decision doesn't feel hard if if
you know what you are going to do

00:19:05.788 --> 00:19:08.788
and if you know yourself and you're
going to do it anyway,

00:19:08.788 --> 00:19:10.413
it doesn't feel very hard.

00:19:11.329 --> 00:19:14.621
I have to say, Danny, I'm a little shocked
to hear you say that you follow

00:19:14.621 --> 00:19:19.913
your intuition because you have spent
most of your career highlighting all

00:19:19.913 --> 00:19:25.288
the fallacies that come into play
when we rely on our intuition.

00:19:25.829 --> 00:19:26.829
Well,

00:19:28.454 --> 00:19:33.788
you really have to distinguish the
judgment from decision making.